BaseConfigLib::packUint128
├── given zero values
│   └── it should return 0
├── given only lower value set
│   └── it should return lower in bits 0-127
├── given only upper value set
│   └── it should return upper in bits 128-255
├── given both values set
│   └── it should pack both correctly
└── given max values
    └── it should return type(uint256).max